## Proposed Changes

### 1. Navigation Controller & Navbar Safeguards
#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.tsx](file:///d:/PROJECTS/LetterPort/frontend/src/components/Navbar.tsx)
- Add a concurrency-safe navigation controller `handleNavigate(e, href)`:
  - If clicking the currently active page (`pathname === href`), prevent redundant transition.
  - If a navigation is already in flight (consecutive click within transition window), bypass the deadlocking Next.js action queue and execute `window.location.href = href`.
  - Add a 750ms safety watchdog timer: if Next.js dev compilation or router transition stalls, automatically navigate via native URL to unfreeze the UI.
  - Reset navigation lock on route change (`useEffect([pathname])`).
- Apply `handleNavigate` to:
  - Desktop nav links (Dashboard, All Letters, Resumen, Add Letter, Search)
  - Logo link
  - Settings dropdown menu items
  - Mobile menu links

